# STATION 9: random(), chance(), ordinal(), hour(), NPC-wide counters.
npc: @test_random
title: Station 9 - Random and time
speaker: Tester

== start
<<set $npc.rolls = $npc.rolls + 1>>
TEST 9: Random and time. This is roll number {ordinal($npc.rolls)} for this NPC (shared by every player). In-game hour: {hour()}.
<<if chance(0.5)>>
  Coin flip: HEADS. Expected: roughly half the time.
<<else>>
  Coin flip: TAILS. Expected: roughly half the time.
<<endif>>
Random 0-5: {random(6)}. Expected: a whole number from 0 to 5, different most times.
-> Roll again
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
